  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Correct order should be :&nbsp; &nbsp; ii&nbsp; &lt;&nbsp; i&nbsp; &lt;&nbsp; iv &lt; iii<br /><br />(i) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo></math>hybridised, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>Amine without delocalization.<br /><br />(ii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;hybridised.<br /><br />(iii) Guanidine is a stronger base than amidine (resonance stabilised)<br /><br />(iv)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>&nbsp;Amine, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> hybridised.<br />&nbsp;",
